+/* Fetch an attribute value as a C string. If the attribute is `class` and a
+ * class override is given, the override is used (the mutation committed
+ * before the check, so live DOM holds the new value for both branches).
+ * Returns a malloc'd string, or NULL if the attribute is absent. */
